5,0,1,talk,Kenji,,Hi everyone! This is going to be exciting. Let's all try our best to find the werewolf!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Victoria,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. Let us remain rational and observe each other carefully.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Toshio,,I agree. A calm approach is best.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,George,,Indeed. Let's not rush into any hasty conclusions.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Yay! A mystery game! I'm going to find the wolf in no time!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Sakura, you're so confident! Do you have a plan already?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
