31,1,1,talk,Kenji,,Good morning! I hope everyone slept well. Any thoughts for today?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I have information. I am the Seer, and I divined Sakura last night. She is the werewolf.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"That was fast. Victoria, are you certain?","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,George,,"It seems a bit abrupt to reveal yourself so quickly, Victoria.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Sakura,,What?! No way! I'm just a kid! Victoria is lying!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"Whoa, really? Sakura is the wolf? I can't believe it!","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Victoria,,I am certain. The divination does not lie.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"If Victoria is the Seer, the game ends today. But if she's the wolf lying, she's trying to frame Sakura.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,George,,"That is the dilemma. However, Victoria's tone is very convincing.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"I'm not the wolf! @Kenji, you believe me, right?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I want to believe you, Sakura, but Victoria seems so sure...","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"I have no reason to lie. If I were the werewolf, I wouldn't draw this much attention to myself immediately.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"George, you've been very quiet. What do you think?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,George,,"I find it hard to believe a ten-year-old is the wolf, but logic dictates we trust the Seer's claim.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Sakura,,This is unfair! I'm just Sakura!,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I think we should trust Victoria. Sorry, Sakura!","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Victoria,,It is the only rational choice for the village.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I agree. The evidence provided by the Seer is too direct to ignore.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,George,,I will go along with the majority.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Sakura,,You're all mean! I'm not the wolf!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
